      "avg_logprob": -0.1947,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.055603
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 9.52,
      "end": 13.52,
      "text": "America's anti-abortion movement is gaining ground fast,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1947,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.055603
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 13.52,
      "end": 16.52,
      "text": "and it's white evangelical Christians on the front line.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1947,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.055603
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 16.52,
      "end": 21.52,
      "text": "We will see Roe vs. Wade consigned to the ash heap of history",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1947,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.055603
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 21.52,
      "end": 23.52,
      "text": "where it belongs.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1947,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.055603
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 23.52,
      "end": 24.52,
      "text": "I promise.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1947,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.055603
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 24.52,
      "end": 26.52,
      "text": "They're a strident force in the pro-life movement,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1947,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.055603
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 26.52,
      "end": 29.52,
      "text": "but not so long ago this group was completely indifferent",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1947,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.055603
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 29.52,
      "end": 31.52,
      "text": "on the issue of abortion.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.054253,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009544
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 31.52,
      "end": 33.52,
      "text": "So what happened?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.054253,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009544
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 33.52,
      "end": 37.52,
      "text": "This is how a group of men turned millions of disengaged Americans",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.054253,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009544
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 37.52,
      "end": 43.57,
      "text": "into the most powerful political force in the country.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.054253,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009544
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 43.57,
      "end": 45.57,
      "text": "It's hard to believe now,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.054253,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009544
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 45.57,
      "end": 49.57,
      "text": "but abortion hasn't always been the political firestorm that it is today.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.054253,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009544
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 49.57,
      "end": 52.57,
      "text": "Early on before Reagan,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.054253,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009544
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 52.57,
      "end": 57.57,
      "text": "the Republican Party was actually more abortion friendly than Democrats.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.054253,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009544
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 57.57,
      "end": 61.57,
      "text": "The Republican Party was conservative like state intervention",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.105662,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00038
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 61.57,
      "end": 64.57,
      "text": "and people's personal lives and so forth.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.105662,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00038
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 64.57,
      "end": 67.57,
      "text": "This meant that in 1973,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.105662,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00038
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 67.57,
      "end": 72.57,
      "text": "the landmark Roe vs. Wade decision would legalise abortion across the country.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.105662,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00038
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 72.57,
      "end": 76.57,
      "text": "The decision to end the pregnancy belongs to the woman and her doctor,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.105662,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00038
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 76.57,
      "end": 78.57,
      "text": "not the government.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.105662,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00038
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 78.57,
      "end": 81.57,
      "text": "The only significant group to object was the Catholic Church,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.105662,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00038
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 81.57,
      "end": 83.57,
      "text": "and they had always done so.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.105662,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00038
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 83.57,
      "end": 86.57,
      "text": "White evangelicals were then,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.105662,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00038
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 86.57,
      "end": 89.57,
      "text": "as now, the biggest religious group in the country.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08136,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000437
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 89.57,
      "end": 92.57,
      "text": "They made up 26% of the population.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08136,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000437
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 92.57,
      "end": 94.57,
      "text": "But unlike today,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08136,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000437
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 94.57,
      "end": 98.57,
      "text": "they were ambivalent on the issue of abortion and politics in general.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08136,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000437
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 98.57,
      "end": 102.57,
      "text": "Evangelicals regarded abortion as a Catholic issue,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08136,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000437
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 102.57,
      "end": 108.57,
      "text": "and it was really irrelevant to who they were or what they cared about.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08136,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000437
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 108.57,
      "end": 111.57,
      "text": "They were more interested in evangelism,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08136,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000437
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 111.57,
      "end": 113.57,
      "text": "that is, bringing others into the faith,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08136,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000437
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 113.57,
      "end": 117.57,
      "text": "and they had really no interest in politics.",
