      "avg_logprob": -0.083637,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001925
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "start": 330.94,
      "end": 334.94,
      "text": "that when you interrupt a pregnancy, you are taking a human life.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.083637,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001925
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "start": 334.94,
      "end": 339.94,
      "text": "And that appears to have helped them with evangelicals",
